          ],
          "note": "Read as \"Krämer / Wössler\". Countersigned by Wissler (https://w3id.org/condon-rolls/hands#wissler); an act has one actor in linked-rolls, so the countersignature is stated here only."
         },
         {
          "@type": "inference",
